                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 flex-grow">
                        Introduction to AAC systems and how to implement them effectively in school and clinical settings.
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700 border-t border-gray-200 pt-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>📅</span>
                            <span>August 12, 2026 at 4:00 PM</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>⏱️</span>
                            <span>120 minutes</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>💰</span>
                            <span class="font-semibold">R250 ZAR</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>🎓</span>
                            <span class="font-semibold">8 CPD Points</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>👥</span>
