                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow hover:shadow-lg transition-smooth overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 flex flex-col">
                <div class="h-40 bg-gradient-primary flex items-center justify-center text-5xl">
                    👂
                </div>
                <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
                    <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-3 w-fit">
                        🎧 For Educators
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 line-clamp-2">
                        Hearing Loss & Classroom Accommodations
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4 flex-grow">
                        Understanding hearing loss and creating an accessible classroom environment for deaf and hard of hearing students.
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700 border-t border-gray-200 pt-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>📅</span>
                            <span>August 19, 2026 at 3:00 PM</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>⏱️</span>
                            <span>90 minutes</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>💰</span>
                            <span class="font-semibold">R150 ZAR</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span>🎓</span>
